\subsection*{Corollaries}

\textbf{Corollary 1 (Replay Determinism).}  
Given $\{H_t\}$ and $S_0$, the entire sequence $\{S_t\}$ is uniquely reconstructible.

\textbf{Corollary 2 (Epistemic Tier: Proven).}  
If Theorems 1–7 hold, the system resides in the epistemic tier:
\[
E_{\text{proven}}.
\]

\textbf{Corollary 3 (Foundational Reference Architecture).}  
If Theorems 2, 4, and 7 hold, the architecture is suitable as a foundational reference model for future multi-domain deterministic engines.

